# The Gradle wrapper is committed rather than ignored.
#
# The Flutter template ignores `gradlew` and `gradle-wrapper.jar` on the
# assumption that `flutter create` can put them back. A fresh clone has to be
# buildable without a
# `flutter create` step, and a build that needs a network round trip to Gradle's
# distribution server before it can resolve anything is a build that fails for a
# reason nobody can see.
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
